Package: pkgstate
Type: Package
Title: Read-Only Introspection of 'dpkg' and 'APT' State
Version: 0.0.1.9
Date: 2026-08-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Structured, read-only queries of installed-package state ('dpkg')
    and archive metadata ('APT'): installed packages, candidate versions,
    origins, and upgradeability, returned as plain data frames. Part of the
    Runix system-administration framework; mutations are out of scope (general
    'APT' mutations live in a separate sibling package, and 'rapt' is the r2u
    binary package-install backend).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: dpkg, apt
Imports: runix
Suggests: janssonr (>= 0.0.1.1), tinytest
Additional_repositories: https://cornball-ai.github.io/drat
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
